<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Loan Quick Guide</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f3f6fb;
    color: #222;
}

header {
    background: #082747;
    color: white;
    padding: 25px 15px;
    text-align: center;
}

header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 28px;
}

.hero {
    padding: 55px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg,#0879c9,#082747);
    color: white;
}

.hero h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
}

.hero p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.container {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 25px auto;
    padding: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #00000010;
}

.card h3 {
    color: #0879c9;
}

footer {
    background: #082747;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>LOAN QUICK GUIDE</h1>
    <p>Understand Loan Costs Before Borrowing</p>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <h2>Understand Your Loan</h2>
    <p>
        Learn about interest rates, processing fees,
        repayment terms and important loan conditions.
    </p>
</section>

<div class="container">

    <div class="card">
        <h3>1. Check Interest Rates</h3>
        <p>
        Always check the annual interest rate before
        considering any loan.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>2. Processing Fees</h3>
        <p>
        Check whether processing fees, taxes or other
        charges are deducted from the loan amount.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>3. Repayment Terms</h3>
        <p>
        Read the repayment schedule, EMI amount,
        late payment charges and total repayment amount.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>4. Important Safety Information</h3>
        <p>
        Verify the lender, read the loan agreement
        and understand all charges before making
        any financial decision.
        </p>
    </div>

</div>

<footer>
    <p>Loan Quick Guide</p>
    <p>Educational information only. No loan approval or eligibility is guaranteed.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
